Heighten the fears of those near to you. Any foe you attempt to inflict a fear upon and who remains in a radius of 8 and in sight of you for 4 (non-consecutive) turns, will take [14, 19, 23, 26, 29 (TL1-5; MP 100)] mind and [14, 19, 23, 26, 29 (TL1-5; MP 100)] darkness damage and gain a new fear that lasts for 8 turns.

This effect completely ignores fear resistance, but can be saved against.
